WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.240
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.820
I don't have any sense for design.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:22.830
Ever since Elza-san made me realize that, try as I might, I haven't been able to get Star Wings.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:28.670
But now Koharu-chan is going to help out Berry Parfait as a designer.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:33.550
I can't contain my excitement waiting to see what kind of dress we'll make!

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:40.560
I saw Koharu come early this morning to think up dress designs with Yume.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.560
They didn't waste any time.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:47.940
I was concerned for Yume since she's been distraught about being unable to design well.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:53.820
Perfect Elza has judged Koharu's designer potential to be extremely high.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:01:00.330
Yume-san must feel reassured to have her best friend and design expert by her side.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.330
She's the best right-hand girl she could have!

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.960
We can finally rest assured. {I know but}

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.750
Rola and Lily-senpai, why don't you sit and have tea with us?{okay I think this one should actually}

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.040
No can do.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.420
This is Yume's seat.

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.720
It's for the top of Song Class.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.600
Only the leaders of each class in S4 are allowed to sit here.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:23.060
Isn't that why we all strive to make it?

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:24.600
Well said!

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.480
Sorry, Rola.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:27.770
It's fine.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.730
Yume!

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:35.990
Koharu.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:37.820
Care for some tea?

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.740
Thanks, Rola.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:44.450
But right now I need some alone time to think. Maybe next time.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.130
Yume, did something happen with Koharu?

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:52.550
Not really.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:56.050
Well, why don't you sit down, and we can talk over tea...

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:59.140
Sorry, Rola, but I'm not in the mood today.

00:02:00.430 --> 00:02:01.760
Bye.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:09.770
Those two were totally awkward with each other!

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:13.650
Yuzu, that is not something you should be saying with a smile.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:17.780
But come on! It's not every day you see them fighting!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:20.780
I super wanna know what happened!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.410
It's not just rare. It's the first time I've ever seen it.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.870
What happened between them?

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:15.400
Did Koharu-chan give you that candy?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.190
Yuzu-senpai, Lily-senpai.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.440
Not gonna eat it?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:21.030
I...

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:23.150
What occurred?

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:24.780
We'll hear you out!

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:32.120
We were both really pumped up, 
ready to make the loveliest dress together.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.660
But then...

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.750
Every time you sigh, a bit of happiness escapes.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.260
Rola! Mahiru-chan and Ako-chan too. {I am fairly certain this is how this is}{if you say so}

00:04:42.260 --> 00:04:44.260
You can tell us about it.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.140
Okay. At first...

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.310
What do you think of my designs?

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:55.390
Don't you think they're kind of too different from Berry Parfait's brand image?

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.190
The colors and styles seem like a different brand's. {so you didn't pick up the repetition later}

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.190
It's important to be impactful.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.440
It has to be surprising enough to leave an impression.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:07.240
But my gut is telling me that it's <i>too</i> different.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.080
Our fans might be taken aback.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:13.120
Didn't you want to create a completely new dress?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.500
I do, but it's important to consider how Berry Parfait's fans feel.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.750
I have a responsibility to protect them.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:24.510
If you just protect them, you'll never make anything new!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.060
All I wanted was to assist Yume-chan.

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:34.930
Not only did I fail, but we ended up arguing.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:40.690
I bet you want to make up as soon as possible, but you have no idea where to start.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:45.190
I know how you feel. I've fought with Yume before too.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.320
So how did you do it?

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.700
Well...

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:53.290
Oh! Ako and Mahiru, don't you need to leave for your gig?

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.330
Yes, but...

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.590
We don't want our lead actress getting in trouble for being late.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.130
Koharu!

00:06:00.590 --> 00:06:02.800
Rola, we'll leave this to you.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:03.840
Okay!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:07.010
Koharu, could you lend me a hand for a bit?

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:13.470
How could I end up fighting with Koharu-chan...

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:17.980
It's only natural you have different opinions. That's what makes things interesting.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:23.360
Butting heads and occasionally quarreling is proof that you both are serious. {this was, believe it or not, deliberate}

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.990
That doesn't make it any easier.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:28.320
Fights are fine once in a while.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:30.620
It happens to us as well.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:31.570
Right?

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:35.330
Huh, really? Then how do you make up...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.120
<b>Sakuraba Rola</b>

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:42.130
Pardon us, we must be on our way to a job.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.130
Bye-bye!

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:46.510
Okay. Take care.

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.590
Rola?

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.640
Hello!

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.640
We've been waiting, Yume.

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.770
Yume-senpai!

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.150
I have a favor to ask you both.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.990
Could you give some advice to the Song Class girls?

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.160
Stop, stop! You need to <i>project</i>!

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.120
Plus you're entirely out of alignment! I'm not hearing a chorus!

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.790
Girls, straighten your backs. {yeah that was too much}

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:27.000
Just like with modeling, you need proper posture for singing.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.300
That's right.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.050
Feet shoulder-width apart.

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:34.430
Loosen your shoulders, open your chest, and relax.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:40.690
Also, the most important thing when singing in a group is to sync your breathing and feelings.

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:44.400
Exactly. Just like when you make a dress, right?

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.690
Okay, once more!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.650
Yes!

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.030
That's the way!

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.210
We have to say goodbye today.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.330
Thank you, Alala. {gonna make a huge leap and guess it's because he's a Ko-ala}

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.590
Be well!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.840
Cut! Okay!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.850
Thank you very much!

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:20.430
Here.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:25.310
How often do you think a chance to hug a koala comes along?

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.230
Come on, quickly.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.690
So fluffy!

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.360
And cute!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.110
Now those are some nice smiles.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.580
I can't see you any other way.

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:43.210
Drama is an explosion! {ep 6}

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.420
Ako-chan, I need a retake on that last scene!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.170
Huh?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:51.630
Hold back your pain and part with a smile! How's that?!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:54.430
I see.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:58.050
Understood. Please shoot it once more!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.260
Good! I'm counting on you.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:05.900
Really? But your acting was so moving, Ako-chan.

00:09:05.900 --> 00:09:07.440
This is such a waste.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:11.900
The director is devoting himself to making the best drama he possibly can.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.070
I am no different.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:18.820
I'll do it over as many times it takes to make a respectable product.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.330
Doesn't that go for you two as well?

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:26.080
You both want to create a good dress. Your feelings are the same.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:38.970
When shared, joy is doubled and sorrow halved. {so, the original is by a German poet Tiedge. However, the most common form is apparently a Swedish proverb. a japanese site suggests "When shared, joy is doubled and sorrow halved". pick whichever}{do we have to pick one of those? why not "Joy shared is jay doubled; sorrow shared is sorrow halved"?}{I mean you could, but I kind of like this version}

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:44.680
Thanks to all of you here today, my joy is several hundredfold increased.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.060
It's a proverb!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:46.850
I'm touched!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:50.360
It's a calendar full of Shirogane Lily's proverbs! {I shouldn't be surprised}

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:53.360
Monthly Lily is now on sale!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.110
It's Yuzu-chan from S4!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:10:00.870
Lilienne'll sign them for you, so please form an orderly line!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.620
Okay!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:08.750
Yuzu-senpai, shouldn't you have let the employees here take care of the line?

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.750
Thank you!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.130
Aren't you busy with your own work?

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:14.760
I'm doing it because I wanted to assist Lilienne.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.130
Is it not the same for you?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:25.180
Yuzu-senpai, thank you for your cooperation.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.060
Anytime!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:29.480
Let us leave them to sort the rest out themselves.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:32.980
Okay. I'm sure they'll be fine.

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:39.070
Everyone's been trying to help us make up.

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:41.990
Yeah. We must have really worried them.

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.500
It's really coming down.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.380
Koharu-chan?

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:57.550
Something like this happened to us before.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.470
Do you remember? It was back in elementary school.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:09.520
It started to rain while we were playing, 
and it only got heavier and darker as we waited.

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.530
It cast a cloud over my heart...

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.110
But you were there for me the whole time.

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.530
I wasn't scared after that.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.540
I was the same.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.250
I'm sure I would've cried by myself.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.500
But because you were there, I had fun.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.090
It wasn't scary at all.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:39.210
Yume-chan...

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:44.600
I'm sorry for acting like that after you went through all the effort of designing for me.

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.350
No, it was my fault too.

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:53.480
I should've been more considerate of the things you hold dear.

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.030
I'm sorry.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.570
Now we're even.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:04.410
Yeah.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.240
Oh, right.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.580
Ah, that candy...

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.910
It's one of the ones you gave me.

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.830
You still keep it around?

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.380
Of course!

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:21.220
I can't eat it anymore, but it's always given me strength before important performances.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.880
<i>I'm pretty sure that color...</i>

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:25.180
Still...

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.050
I can't bear to part with the last one. {doushitemo what? well first I need to make sure the line three up is "can't eat any more" and not "won't eat any more", but after that... I think this is close}{I don't understand what you are}

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.350
Yume-chan, open it up!

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:30.980
But...

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:31.850
Just do it!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.350
O-Okay.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.150
Hey...

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.110
Yep!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:47.410
My current dream is to create a dress with you.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:48.870
Koharu-chan!

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.380
Look, a rainbow!

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.090
How pretty!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.380
That's it!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.810
Are you serious about this?

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:22.110
Yes. I want to change the brand name of Berry Parfait.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:26.780
Do you fully appreciate the significance of changing a brand's name?

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:31.410
Do you plan to abandon everything you've worked hard to build up?

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:35.160
No, I won't abandon it. I'm enhancing it. {this is one of those thesaurus lines}{enhance!}

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.290
Enhance it?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:41.170
I don't personally have the skills to design.{tariru yeah but}

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:45.800
That's why I want to borrow Koharu-chan's power and make everyone shine.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.800
I need to change the brand's name to incorporate this desire.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.180
The risk will be high.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:56.940
I know. I also understand that our fans may be taken aback at first.

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:57.810
Even so—

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:01.980
I believe I know what they'll say after seeing my new dress:

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:05.990
"These colors are nice. I never expected this style to work.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.570
It's so much fun!"

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:13.620
Soon the whole town will be filled with people wearing our dresses!

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.120
And we'll all be happy-happy! {come on Yume}{yeah}

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.040
I just know it!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.550
You're so positive I can't keep a straight face.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:29.680
It's a bit naïve, but very true to yourself.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.970
I owe it all to Koharu-chan.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:35.430
Being with her allows me to be myself.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:36.810
Yume-chan...

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:40.310
Very well. Do as you see fit.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.820
Thank you!

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:49.780
So? I expect that you have a design ready given that you plan to start a new brand.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:50.950
Of course.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:56.580
This is the Premium Rare Dress 
Yume-chan and I created together.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.420
This is...

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:07.300
Yume Nijino started a new brand?

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:11.390
She's about to hold its first debut show. {yeah I dont' know what I was thinking}

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.680
Intriguing, isn't it?

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.810
What's all this about a new brand?

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.190
What about Berry Parfait?

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.570
They didn't tell me about this!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.650
I'm all jittery!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.450
This gets me going!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:36.200
Let us imprint their feelings into our hearts.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.580
It's a koala!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.290
It's holding candy! How adorable!

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:49.460
Hello! My name is Sweety Berry.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:53.680
Everyone, do you know why rainbows are beautiful?

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:57.510
That's because rainbows are more than one color.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:16:04.560
Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, violet.{nice, they used a real rainbow and not the one with fake indigo}{honestly I'm just kind of weirded out every time I see cyan called blue}

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.770
The seven different colors come together as one.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:13.950
We'll fill you with the same emotion that overcomes you when you see a rainbow!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.700
Nijino Yume's new brand:

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.330
Rainbow Berry Parfait!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.840
<i>The Rainbow Étoile Coord.{we usually do this right}{aye}</i>

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:31.010
<i>Star-studded splendor with a rainbow gradation.</i>

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:36.760
<i>I can enhance everyone's radiance with this dress I made with Koharu-chan! {ehhh ok I guess it's something I'd so}</i>

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.970
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.560
Yume-chan!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:15.270
I'm so glad, Yume-chan!

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.940
I'm really so, so glad!

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:22.570
I wouldn't have it without you, Koharu-chan. Thank you.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:28.080
Come on, if you start crying, I won't be able to.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.330
S-Sorry.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.330
Audience, allow me to introduce you.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:38.840
This is my best friend, fellow idol, 
and designer, Nanakura Koharu-chan!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.300
What, Koharu-chan?

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.720
It really is Koharu-chan!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:50.350
I couldn't have made my Rainbow Étoile Coord without her.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:52.600
Koharu-chan, say a few words.

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:53.480
Huh?!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.860
Okay...

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:02.490
I recently spent a period of time studying design.

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:06.490
Both in Italy and at Venus Ark.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:11.240
I wanted to make an eye-popping dress the likes of which no one had seen before. {two errors at once?}

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:15.870
Yume-chan cares more about her fans than anything else.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.500
It was that kindness that inspired me.

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:25.510
I decided to create a dress to draw out her unseen charms for you all to appreciate.

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.760
Koharu-chan...

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:35.390
I want to bring out the brilliance of Yume-chan and of everyone who wears Rainbow Berry Parfait!{I'm pretty sure that's what the to is}{I figured that out after}

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.150
This is my Aikatsu!

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.740
Rainbow Berry Parfait is going to capture hearts!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:46.780
It will!

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:51.620
It appears their clash has only served to strengthen their friendship.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:55.460
An exemplar of ground hardening after rain! {this one's kind of loose}

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.370
There's our proverb!

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:00.290
Congrats, Yume and Koharu!

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:11.300
Fantastic, Koharu.

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:13.930
You've done a good job.

